<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-PRESIDENT'S XI BEAT ENGLAND BY 5 WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PRESIDENT'S XI BEAT ENGLAND BY 5 WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Zimbabwe President's XI beat England by five wickets in their 50 overs match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: England 211-5 (50 overs), President's XI 215-5 (45.5).</p>
</text>
